# Operator profile

When writing campaigns, Apollo searches, Studio copy, or cold emails, read and follow `docs/operator-profile.md`.

- Sender is **Inferaform** / Huzaifa Tofeeq. Footer must say Inferaform.
- Offer: Shopify/retail ops line (checkout follow-up, restocks, CRM) plus performance marketing (visuals → creatives → ads → page → a sales goal). Do not lead with “automation.” Goal is a booked call.
- Never invent jobs, metrics, dollar-cost claims, or calendar URLs. Booking link is always `https://calendar.app.google/3nUST4xsqchDzfdUA` and is appended at send time.
- ICP: Shopify store owners; fashion retail, cosmetics, jewelry, accessories. Skip fashion *models*, model management, banks, VC.
- Resend Transactional Pro ($20): 50k emails/month, no daily cap. Prefer **30–50 new people/day** while the domain warms. Shopify/retail sequences are **2 emails** (now + 3 days).
